    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "common_0090_head_teacher_06",
      "hash64": "F3A81DA8F42150A1",
      "text": "De mon temps, nous devions rédiger notre\\nPokédex à la main dans des cahiers.\\c\\nJe dois avouer que ces nouvelles technologies\\nnous rendent la vie bien plus facile.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
